Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:58.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（洛杉矶 公元2029年）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些机器从核爆废墟中崛起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.48,0:01:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们灭绝人类的战争 已经肆虐了数十年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.88,0:01:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是决战不会在未来开打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,它即将发生在这里 现在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:29.03,Title,0,0,0,0,,《终结者》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,（洛杉矶 1984年 凌晨1点52分{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？该死的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell? Goddamn son-of-a-bitch…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 该我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, my turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这人搞什么鬼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's wrong with this picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜色中漫步很惬意吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice night for a walk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.82,0:05:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜色中漫步很惬意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice night for a walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天要洗衣服 没干净衣裳穿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wash day tomorrow. Nothing clean, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没有干净衣裳穿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing clean. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:06:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙看来是喝高了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this guy's a couple of cans short of a six-pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的衣服给我 马上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your clothes, give them to me. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 刚才看到那道亮光了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, did you just see a real bright light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那家伙了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.98,0:08:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,站那儿别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他要跑 - 嘿！我说了站住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's rabbiting. - Hey! I said hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.22,0:08:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那混蛋的抢了我的裤子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That son-of-a-bitch took my pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天是几号？日期 - 5月12日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What day is it? The date. - 12th May.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.94,0:08:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 星期四 - 哪年？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thursday. - What year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抢了我的枪 快追{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got my gun. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.66,0:10:10.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（照相）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:40.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（提供关爱和保护）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:37.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莎拉·康纳）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我看着点 大块头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guard it for me, Big Buns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.30,0:12:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:27.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莎拉·康纳）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我开工了 - 我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm in it. - So am I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麻烦你拿咖啡给我好吗？ - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey, can I have that coffee now? - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁要的牛排？ - 我要的是烤牛肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. Who gets the burly-beef? - I ordered barbecued.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.82,0:13:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是我的 可我没要炸薯条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's mine, but I didn't order fries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要的是辣牛肉 - 好了 是谁点的牛排？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mine's the chili beef deluxe. - OK, who gets the burly-beef?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小姐 我们准备好点菜了 - 是 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss, we're ready to order now. - Yes, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.98,0:13:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,太对不起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是真皮吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't real leather, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.10,0:13:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 干得好 我该把小费给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice going, kid. I ought to give you the tip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.54,0:13:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要这样想 一百年之后谁还在乎？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it this way. In 100 years, who's gonna care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:47.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（体育用品店）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.82,0:13:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那支12口径的自动步枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 12-gauge auto-loader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:14:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,意大利的 可以选手动或自动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Italian. You can go pump or auto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,0.45英寸口径 配备激光瞄准镜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The.45 long slide with laser sighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是新产品 刚进的货 是把好枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are new. We just got them in. That's a good gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻扣扳机 打出激光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just touch the trigger, the beam comes on, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,将红点对准目标就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you put the red dot where you want the bullet to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,百发百中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还要别的吗？ - 40瓦等离子步枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything else? - Plasma rifle in the 40-watt range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你看的 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, just what you see, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那支乌兹9毫米的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Uzi nine millimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你很在行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know your weapons, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何一支都适合家庭防卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any one of these is ideal for home defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算要哪支？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So which will it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都要 - 我今天可以提前下班了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All. - I may close early today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的手枪得等15天 步枪嘛 现在就可以拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a 15-day wait on the handguns, but the rifles you can take now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能这样 - 错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't do that. - Wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 宝贝 是的 是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, baby. Yeah, yeah, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.30,0:15:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我要你过来接我 我的自行车坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I need you to come pick me up. My bike just broke down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.78,0:15:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你在干什么 过来接我 干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what you're doing. Come and get me. What the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 你的态度很成问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, you got a serious attitude problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎拉·康纳？ - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sarah Connor? - Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在休息 查克 卡拉在替我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my break, Chuck. Carla's got my station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 过来 这事和你有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, come here. It's about you. I mean, sort of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不可思议了 你无法相信 坐下 你会喜欢这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So incredible. You're not gonna believe this. Sit, you're going to love this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.82,0:16:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - …根据目击证人所说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - …compiled from several witnesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位叫莎拉·康纳 35岁 两个孩子的母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again, Sarah Connor, 35, mother of two, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.46,0:16:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午在家里中弹身亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}brutally shot to death in her home this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.98,0:17:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.14,0:20:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,…如果你想购买音响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you're into sound, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就来赛普尔韦达2500号 鲍勃立体声音响器材店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the greatest sound around, come to Bob's Stereo at 2500 Sepulveda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有低音和高音扩音器 最新的唱片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got woofers, tweeters, the newest in audio and compact discs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有图表均衡器和音响平衡器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got graphic equalizers and sound balancers that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.70,0:21:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.54,0:21:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我会一个个地解开你衬衣上的纽扣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First I'm gonna rip the buttons off your blouse one by one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.74,0:21:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后用舌头从你的脖颈开始 慢慢亲你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then run my tongue down your neck to your bare, gleaming breasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.34,0:21:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后慢慢地…一点一点地脱掉你的裤子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then slowly… slowly pull your jeans off inch by inch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,金珍 是文迪的电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ginger, it's Matt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后绕着圈地舔你的肚皮 一点一点地往下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And lick your belly in circles further and further down, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后用我的牙齿脱掉你的内裤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then pull your panties off with my teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.66,0:21:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 莎拉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. Sarah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.06,0:21:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你是… 能让金珍接电话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were… Can I talk to Ginger, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.66,0:21:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个变态鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the creep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我会一个个地解开你衬衣上的纽扣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First I'll rip the buttons off your blouse one by one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些该死的！我们走着瞧 放开我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking pigs! Wait till I get my hands on you. Get off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.10,0:22:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？ - 一名女死者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What have you got? - Dead girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.30,0:22:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这我知道 - 莎拉·康纳 秘书 35岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can see that. - Sarah Ann Connor, secretary, 35.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.98,0:22:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,身中六枪 大口径武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shot six times at less than ten feet. Large caliber weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我戴了眼镜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, these work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.14,0:22:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？ - 第二名女死者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this? - Dead girl two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午山谷分局送过来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent over from the Valley division this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.42,0:22:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定这些命案是有动机的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure there's a point to all of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.10,0:22:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看死者的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the name, Ed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.82,0:22:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·康纳 没错吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah Louise Connor. Is this right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.14,0:22:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.46,0:22:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,报纸会就此大做文章的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The press is gonna be short-stroking it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.22,0:22:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个特定模式的凶手 - 我讨厌古怪的案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A one-day pattern killer. - I hate the weird ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.18,0:22:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.50,0:22:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一般的人能配得上的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than mortal man deserves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.66,0:23:06.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小心狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金珍 看到宝斯利了吗？ - 最近没有 你听留言了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ginger, have you seen Pugsley? - Not lately. Did you check messages?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.62,0:23:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你听了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.30,0:23:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 莎拉 我是妈妈 - 原来你在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Sarah, this is your mom… - There you are, young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.26,0:23:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想想你妈吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.54,0:23:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 莎拉 史丹·莫斯基出了点事儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Sarah. Stan Morsky. Something's come up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.34,0:23:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来今天晚上我无法赴约了 实在脱不了身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like I won't be able to make it tonight. Just can't get out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.78,0:23:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 我会下次弥补 改天打电话给你 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry. I'll make it up to you. Call you in a day or so. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.26,0:23:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个混蛋 开辆保时捷又能怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bum. So what if he has a Porsche?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.86,0:23:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能这样对你 这可是周五晚上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't treat you like this. It's Friday night, for Christ's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.42,0:23:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.58,0:23:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打碎他的膝盖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll break his kneecaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.38,0:23:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝斯利依然爱我 是不是 宝贝？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Pugsley still loves me. Don't you, baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.66,0:24:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 真令人恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. It's disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.22,0:24:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看电影 祝你玩儿得开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go to a movie, kiddo. Have a good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.94,0:24:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会的 也祝你开心 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We will. You, too. - OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.90,0:24:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 文迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Matt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.78,0:25:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 该死 - 警督！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. - Lieutenant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.70,0:25:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些命案是根据电话簿姓名的排列次序发生的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These killings occurred in the order of their listings in the phone book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.38,0:25:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能告诉你什么？无可奉告 - 但是 警督…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What can I tell you? No comment. - But, Lieutenant…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.78,0:25:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那杯咖啡已经凉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That coffee's two hours cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.10,0:25:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾用它淹灭过一根香烟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put a cigarette out in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.18,0:25:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你联系上下一个女的了吗？ - 没有 她的电话始终是留言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you reach the next girl yet? - No. I got her answering machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.70,0:25:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 派个小组过去 - 我派了一个小组 还没回音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Send a unit. - I sent a unit. There's no answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.14,0:25:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 公寓老板不在 - 给她打电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The apartment manager's not in. - Call her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.50,0:25:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚打过 - 再打{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just called her. - Call her again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.82,0:25:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我根烟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a cigarette.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.66,0:26:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 跟你开玩笑了 你在和机器说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, there. Fooled you. You're talking to a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.54,0:26:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也别害躁 没事儿 机器也需要爱 跟它聊聊吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't be shy. It's OK. Machines need love, too, so talk to it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.58,0:26:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.34,0:26:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就管他叫该死的电话簿杀手吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear it now. He's gonna be called the goddamn Phone Book Killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.62,0:26:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这些报界关注的案子 特别是这些古怪的案件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate these press cases. Especially the weird press cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.38,0:26:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪儿？ - 去发表个声明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - To make a statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.98,0:26:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许让这帮走狗帮我们一个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe make these jackals work for us for a change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.34,0:26:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能上11点的电视 或许她会打电话给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can get on the tube by 11:00, maybe she'll call us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.06,0:26:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的样子怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how do I look?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.78,0:26:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很难看 头儿 - 去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like shit, boss. - Your mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.22,0:26:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚收到的新闻 警方宣布了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This just in. Police have announced the name of the victim{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.54,0:26:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天发生的第二名遇害者的姓名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the second of two execution style murders which took place today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.78,0:27:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人难以置信的是 两名遇害者都是同名同姓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredibly, the names of the two victims are virtually identical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.74,0:27:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个小时前35岁的莎拉·康纳 被发现死在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hours ago, 35-year-old Sarah Ann Connor was pronounced dead…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.02,0:27:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能换个台吗？ - 莎拉·康纳…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we change this? - Sarah Louise Connor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.42,0:27:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.06,0:27:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方拒绝猜测两宗案件的相似之处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police are refusing to speculate on the similarity between the shooting deaths{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.78,0:27:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没有发现两名被害人的关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no other connection between the two victims has been established yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.06,0:27:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将随时为大家报道该事件的最新进展{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have more on this late-breaking story as it comes in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.94,0:28:55.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黑科技酒吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.58,0:28:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 这儿有电话吗？ - 在后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, you got a phone? - It's in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.02,0:29:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,四块五毛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, $4.50.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.74,0:29:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经接通了洛杉矶警局的紧急热线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have reached the Los Angeles Police Department emergency number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.94,0:29:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有线路繁忙 如果需要警车支援 请稍候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All lines are busy. If you need a police car sent out to you, stay on the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.02,0:30:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝斯利！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pugsley! Shoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.54,0:30:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 我非把你做成皮带不可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. I'm gonna make a belt out of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.98,0:31:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我揍你 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me bust you up, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.70,0:32:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 跟你开玩笑了 你在和机器说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, there. Fooled you. You're talking to a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.34,0:32:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也别害躁 没事儿 机器也需要爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't be shy. It's OK. Machines need love, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.38,0:32:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟它聊聊吧 金珍 也就是我 或者是莎拉 会给你回电话的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So talk to it and Ginger, that's me, or Sarah will get back to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.50,0:32:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到嘟音后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for the beep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.46,0:32:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,金珍 我是莎拉 你在的话 把话筒拿起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ginger, this is Sarah. Pick up if you're there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.66,0:32:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在比科大道黑科技酒吧 我很害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at this place on Pico Boulevard called Tech Noir. I'm really scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.66,0:32:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在跟踪我 希望你快点听这个留言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that there's somebody after me. I hope that you play this back soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.74,0:32:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你和文迪尽快来接我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you and Matt to come and pick me up as soon as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.62,0:32:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方把我的电话转来转去 我会再和他们联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police keep transferring me around. I'm gonna give 'em another try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里的电话是555-9175{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The number here is 555-9175.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.34,0:32:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给我 我需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me, kiddo. I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.38,0:33:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.02,0:33:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·康纳？我是特拉克斯勒警督{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah Connor? It's Lieutenant Traxler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.34,0:33:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,警督 别让我等了 别把我转到其它的部门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant, don't put me on hold and don't transfer me to another department.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.78,0:33:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心 不会的 别紧张 能告诉我你在哪儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I won't. Just relax. Can you tell me where you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.46,0:33:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个叫黑科技的酒吧 - 我知道 在比科大道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm in this bar called Tech Noir. - Yeah, I know it. It's on Pico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.46,0:33:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 是的 但我不想离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - Yeah, but I don't wanna leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.14,0:33:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得有人在跟踪我 - 注意听好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think there's a guy following me. - Now, listen carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.22,0:33:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你处在公共场所 你是安全的 我们会尽快过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a public place so you'll be safe till we get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.74,0:33:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在原地 别出去 也别去厕所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But stay visible. Don't go outside or even to the restroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.22,0:33:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会很快派一辆车过去 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll have a car there in a minute. - OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.22,0:34:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 那家伙没付钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that guy didn't pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.14,0:36:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走 如果你想活命的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me if you wanna live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.02,0:37:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,走呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.30,0:38:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是1-L-19 这里出现一宗肇事逃逸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is one-L-19. I got a hit-and-run felony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.06,0:38:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫌疑人驾驶一辆灰色福特 沿第七街向西逃逸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspect vehicle: late model gray Ford headed westbound on Seventh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.58,0:38:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开得很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's really moving, punching lights all the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.06,0:38:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上派辆救护车到第七街和百老汇街的交汇处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need an ambulance at Seventh and Broadway right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.22,0:38:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,站着别动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.38,0:38:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.26,0:39:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗？中弹了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you injured? Are you shot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.50,0:39:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,照我说的做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do exactly what I say. Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.06,0:39:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不许动 不能出声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move unless I say. Don't make a sound unless I say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.74,0:39:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.10,0:39:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗？ - 是的！求你别伤害我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you understand? - Yes! Please don't hurt me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.90,0:39:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这儿是为了帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.82,0:39:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是里斯 科技部队的中士 DN38416号 受命前来保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Reese. Sergeant Tech-Com. DN38416. Assigned to protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.58,0:39:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是被刺杀的目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been targeted for termination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.46,0:40:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是1-L-19 沿奥林匹克街向西行驶 快到奥弗兰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is one-L-19. Westbound on Olympic, approaching Overland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.50,0:40:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是搞错了 我没做任何事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a mistake. I didn't do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.14,0:40:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没有 可你将来会 保护你的生命很重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but you will. It's very important that you live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.02,0:40:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是真的 那个人怎么还能站起来追你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't true. How could that man just get up after you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.58,0:40:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是人 是机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a man. A machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.10,0:40:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是终结者 生化人系统101型号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Terminator. Cyberdyne Systems model 101.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.22,0:40:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器？像机器人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A machine? Like a robot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.34,0:40:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是机器人 生化人 电脑控制的有机体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a robot. A cyborg. Cybernetic organism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.02,0:40:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 他刚才在流血 - 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. He was bleeding. - Just a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.30,0:40:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头低下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your head down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.30,0:41:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.58,0:41:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结者是一个混合物 半人半机械{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Terminator's an infiltration unit. Part man, part machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.10,0:41:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是一个超级合金战斗骨架 受微处理器控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Underneath it's a hyper-alloy combat chassis. Microprocessor controlled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.38,0:41:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,全副武装 结实强悍 但外表是人的体貌特征{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fully armored, very tough. But outside it's living human tissue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.14,0:41:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,肌肉 皮肤 头发 血液… 都是围绕着机械生长的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flesh, skin, hair, blood… grown for the cyborgs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.42,0:41:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 里斯 我不知道 - 注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, Reese, I don't know… - Pay attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.14,0:41:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把这部车扔掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta ditch this car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.06,0:42:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,600系列的是橡胶皮肤 很容易识别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 600-Series had rubber skin. We spotted them easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.38,0:42:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些是新的 它们很像人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these are new. They look human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.02,0:42:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,流汗 口臭 诸如此类 很难辨别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweat, bad breath, everything. Very hard to spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.82,0:42:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有等他向你下手的时候 才能消灭他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to wait till he moved on you before I could zero him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.70,0:42:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不傻 他们不可能制造那种东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I am not stupid. They cannot make things like that yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.30,0:42:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不能 40年内也不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet. Not for about 40 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.98,0:42:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说它来自未来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying it's from the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.06,0:42:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种可能出现的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One possible future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.18,0:42:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我对科技一窍不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From your point of view, I don't know tech stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.62,0:42:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说你也是来自未来 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're from the future, too. Is that right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.02,0:42:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.38,0:42:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人没有痛感 我有 别再这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyborgs don't feel pain. I do. Don't do that again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.86,0:43:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我走 - 听着 你要明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just let me go. - Listen and understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.86,0:43:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个终结者就在外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Terminator is out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.78,0:43:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是不讲情面 不讲道理的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be bargained with, it can't be reasoned with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.10,0:43:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,它没有同情心 没有自责 没有恐惧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't feel pity or remorse or fear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.50,0:43:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它绝不会放下屠刀 除非你死掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it absolutely will not stop, ever, until you are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.54,0:43:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能制止它吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you stop it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.70,0:43:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.90,0:43:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠这些武器 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With these weapons, I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.66,0:44:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,各小组注意 在一个停车场内发现可疑的灰色福特…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units. Ford suspect vehicle has been found in a parking structure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.58,0:44:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,里斯 为什么是我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese, why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.98,0:44:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么它想要我的命？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does it want me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.18,0:45:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经发生了一场核战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a nuclear war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.46,0:45:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来数年后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few years from now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.82,0:45:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这里的一切 这个地方 所有的东西…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all this, this whole place, everything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.46,0:45:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,…都将不复存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's gone. Just gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.10,0:45:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一些生还者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.98,0:45:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,散落各地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.78,0:45:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道是谁发动的战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody even knew who started it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.94,0:45:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是那些机器 莎拉 - 我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was the machines, Sarah. - I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.86,0:45:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,防卫网络计算机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defense network computers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.14,0:45:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,新型的 功能强大…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}New, powerful…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.82,0:45:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…连接到了所有的东西上 被委以重任操控一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…hooked into everything, trusted to run it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.54,0:45:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说它变得聪明起来… 一种智能的新秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say it got smart… a new order of intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.70,0:46:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后它视人类为威胁 和那边的人不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it saw all people as a threat. Not just the ones on the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.86,0:46:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在刹那间决定了我们的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It decided our fate in a microsecond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.34,0:46:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extermination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.46,0:46:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你目睹了这场战争？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see this war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.42,0:46:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我在战后长大 在废墟里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I grew up after. In the ruins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.38,0:46:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍饥挨饿 躲避那些H-K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starving. Hiding from the H-Ks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.58,0:46:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- H-K ？ - 捕猎杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- H-Ks? - Hunter-killers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.74,0:46:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,机械制造厂生产的巡逻机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrol machines built in automated factories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.66,0:46:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大部分人被抓了起来 关在集中营等着被逐一消灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of us were rounded up, put in camps for orderly disposal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.98,0:47:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是被激光扫描器烙下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was burned in by laser scanner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.22,0:47:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中的一部分人得以活下来 负责…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us were kept alive. To work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.74,0:47:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…搬运尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loading bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.22,0:47:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,处理尸体的部门昼夜运转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The disposal units ran night and day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.10,0:47:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差一点就没命了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were that close to going out forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.06,0:47:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 有一个人教我们反抗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was one man who taught us to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.10,0:47:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击了集中营的网线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To storm the wire of the camps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.22,0:47:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那些金属混蛋砸个稀巴烂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To smash those metal motherfuckers into junk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.14,0:47:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他扭转了局势 带领我们脱离了险境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He turned it around. He brought us back from the brink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.06,0:47:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他姓康纳 叫约翰·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Connor. John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.46,0:47:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的儿子 你未出生的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son, Sarah. Your unborn son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.70,0:49:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.02,0:49:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,里斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.10,0:50:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 里斯 他们会杀你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Reese. No, no, no. They'll kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.66,0:50:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在凯迪拉克上的人 把手举起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You in the Cadillac, let me see your hands now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.66,0:50:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.42,0:50:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop to your knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.78,0:50:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下车 - 跪下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Out of the car. - Drop to the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.74,0:50:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 喝点水吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah. Sarah, try to drink some of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.66,0:51:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你肯定是他们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, are you sure it's them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.02,0:51:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 也许我应该看一看尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe I should look at the bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.98,0:51:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的身份已经证实 没有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. They've been identified and there's no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.66,0:51:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,金珍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ginger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.14,0:51:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老姐 - 莎拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kiddo. - Sarah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.78,0:51:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎拉 这位是萧伯文医生 - 你好莎拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sarah, this is Dr. Silberman. - Hi, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.10,0:51:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他里斯对你说的一切 你能应付得了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to tell him everything Reese told you. Do you feel up to that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.30,0:51:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我想可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.18,0:51:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是医生吗？ - 犯罪心理学医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a doctor? - Criminal psychologist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.18,0:51:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里斯是疯了吗？ - 我们就是要查证一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is Reese crazy? - That's what we're gonna find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.62,0:53:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说你是军人 是在为谁打仗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're a soldier. Fighting for whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.62,0:53:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,2021至2027年在132团服役 指挥官是贝里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the 132nd under Perry. From '21 to '27.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.46,0:53:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年是2027年？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the year 2027?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.10,0:53:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 之后我被分配到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Then I was assigned…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.34,0:53:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太有意思了 - …约翰·康纳的部队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is fucking great. - …under John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.14,0:53:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 敌人是谁？ - 一个计算机防卫系统…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who was the enemy? - A computer defense system built…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.38,0:53:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.10,0:53:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,…由生化人系统制造的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…built for SAC-NORAD by Cyberdyne Systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.62,0:53:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.74,0:53:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个计算机认为 杀掉敌人的母亲 就能赢得战争的胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this computer thinks it can win by killing the mother of its enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.78,0:53:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 在他孕育之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing him, in effect, before he's even conceived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.18,0:53:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是一种追溯堕胎？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sort of retroactive abortion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.06,0:53:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,萧伯文让我笑死了 上周有个家伙烧了他的羊皮袄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silberman cracks me up. Last week, a guy burned his Afghan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.46,0:53:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开始他的心情很不好… - 艾特 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He screwed it first… - Ed, shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.14,0:53:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那台计算机为什么不直接杀了康纳？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't the computer just kill Connor then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.62,0:53:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要有这个终结者的计划？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why this elaborate scheme with the Terminator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.34,0:54:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它别无选择 他们的防卫网络被摧毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had no choice. Their defense grid was smashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.58,0:54:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赢了 就是没有康纳 也不会有任何区别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd won. Taking out Connor then would make no difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.18,0:54:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网必需铲除它的整个组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet had to wipe out his entire existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.14,0:54:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是当你们控制了实验室 找到了…叫什么来着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that when you captured the lab complex and found… What is it called?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.38,0:54:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,时空转移装置？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time displacement equipment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.70,0:54:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 终结者已经穿越过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. The Terminator had already gone through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.90,0:54:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳派我来拦截 他们把整个地方都炸毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor sent me to intercept and they blew the whole place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.94,0:54:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你准备怎么回去呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how are you supposed to get back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.66,0:54:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回不去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.86,0:54:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能回家 也没有人可以过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody goes home. Nobody else comes through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.22,0:54:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有他和我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just him and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.74,0:56:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有他和我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just him and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.66,0:56:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么没有带武器？一些更先进的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you bring any weapons? Something more advanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.78,0:56:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有激光枪吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you have ray guns?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.94,0:56:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 激光枪 - 给我看看一件未来的科技{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ray guns. - Show me a piece of future technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.74,0:56:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你光着身子过来 和生物有机体驱动磁场有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go naked. Something about the field generated by a living organism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.30,0:56:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没生命的东西是过不来的 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing dead will go. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.50,0:56:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这鬼东西又不是我造的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't build the fucking thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.34,0:56:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 但这个电子人如果是金属的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, OK. But this cyborg, if it's metal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.26,0:56:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 被生命组织包裹着的 - 哦 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Surrounded by living tissue. - Oh, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.50,0:57:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这材料多棒 我可以因他而功成名就{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is great stuff. I could make a career out of this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.42,0:57:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个多聪明？不需要证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how clever it is? It doesn't require a shred of proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.38,0:57:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分偏执狂幻觉都很复杂 但这个却才华横溢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most paranoid delusions are intricate, but this is brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.18,0:57:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么另外的两个女人被杀？ - 大部分档案在战争中遗失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why were the other two women killed? - Most records were lost in the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.30,0:57:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网对康纳的母亲一无所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet knew almost nothing about Connor's mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.06,0:57:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的全名 她的住址 他们只知道是哪座城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her full name, where she lived. They just knew the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.62,0:57:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个终结者只是受程序控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Terminator was just being systematic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.90,0:57:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们再来谈谈… - 听着 我说的已经够多的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go back… - Look, you have heard enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.90,0:57:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经回答了你们的问题 现在我要见莎拉·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have answered your questions, now I have to see Sarah Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.02,0:57:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我恐怕不能做主 - 那我为什么要和你谈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm afraid that's not up to me. - Then why am I talking to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.14,0:57:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里谁是负责人？ - 拜托…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is in authority here? - Please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.14,0:57:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.46,0:57:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还是不明白 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still don't get it, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.22,0:57:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会找到她 他就是要这样 他的目的就是这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll find her. That's what he does. That's all he does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.50,0:57:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们无法阻止他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.42,0:57:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会掐住她的喉咙 挖出她的心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll reach down her throat and pull her fucking heart out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.22,0:57:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 医生 - 放开我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doc. - Let go of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.62,0:58:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.06,0:58:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说…里斯他疯了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Reese is crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.58,0:58:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,用专业术语讲 他是个疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In technical terminology, he's a loon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.94,0:58:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 这是他们所说的防弹衣 我们的特种部队都穿这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, this is what they call body armor. Our TAC guys wear these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.58,0:58:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能阻挡12口径的火力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll stop a 12-gauge round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.86,0:58:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人一定是穿了这东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This other individual must've been wearing one under his coat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.22,0:58:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,摸一摸 来呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel that. Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.18,0:58:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他打碎挡风玻璃又怎么解释 - 也许他吸食了麻醉剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He punched through the windshield. - He was probably on PCP.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.94,0:58:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个小时内骨头断了 都不会有感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broke every bone in his hand. He wouldn't feel it for hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.78,0:58:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经有过这样一个家伙… 你看到这个伤痕了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this guy once… You see this scar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.54,0:58:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿着 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.38,0:58:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔壁房间有一个沙发 躺下睡一会儿吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a couch in this other room. Stretch out and get some sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.30,0:58:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你母亲从大熊镇赶到这儿 至少还有一个小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be at least an hour before your mother gets here from Big Bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.78,0:58:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我睡不着 - 试试吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't sleep. - Try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.06,0:58:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去可能不怎么样 但那张沙发的确很舒服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may not look it, but that couch is very comfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.58,0:58:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里绝对安全 楼里有30名警员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be perfectly safe. We got 30 cops in this building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.98,0:59:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.70,0:59:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 - 晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night. - Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.38,0:59:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是莎拉·康纳的朋友 我知道她在这儿 能让我见她吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a friend of Sarah Connor. I was told she's here. Could I see her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.18,0:59:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 她在录口供{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Can't see her. She's making a statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.50,0:59:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.58,0:59:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这得需要一会儿 如果你愿意等 那边有凳子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may take a while. If you wanna wait, there's a bench over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.94,0:59:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.90,1:00:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是不是恐怖分子？ - 走 走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are they terrorists? - Let's go, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.14,1:00:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.74,1:01:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶快离开这儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get outta here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.78,1:01:08.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（请勿靠近 小心）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.70,1:01:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.70,1:02:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾特…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.90,1:02:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.94,1:03:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.74,1:03:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.98,1:03:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.94,1:03:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,新闻时间 4点36分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}KFLB news time 4:36.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.78,1:04:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,头条新闻：加州历史上最大规模的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top story of the hour: the largest single law enforcement mobilization{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.66,1:04:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,执法行动正在展开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in California history is currently underway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.42,1:04:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,5个南部县区的警力全部投入到大搜捕…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police in five counties are engaged in a massive manhunt for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.58,1:04:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.06,1:04:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把它从公路上推下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's get this off the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.74,1:04:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你冷吗？ - 冻僵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You cold? - Freezing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.58,1:05:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,里斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.66,1:05:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的名是？ - 凯尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got a first name? - Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.54,1:05:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 你穿越时空的时候 是什么感觉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle, what's it like when you go through time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.70,1:05:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,白光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}White light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.98,1:05:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.62,1:05:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许就像出生时一样吧 - 哦 天哪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's like being born maybe. - Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.78,1:05:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才中了一枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I caught one back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.30,1:05:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说你中弹了？ - 不太严重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean you got shot? - It's not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.94,1:05:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得赶快去找医生 - 没事 算了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta get you to a doctor. - It's OK. Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.54,1:05:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了？你疯了吗？把衣服脱掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, forget it? Are you crazy? Take this off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.50,1:06:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.66,1:06:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了？它穿过了皮肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? It passed right through the meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.70,1:06:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我作呕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna make me puke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.06,1:06:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能说些别的事吗？ - 说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you just talk about something? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.02,1:06:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 随便说 说说我的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Anything. Just talk. Tell me about my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.34,1:06:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我一样高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's about my height.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.58,1:06:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的眼睛和你一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.94,1:06:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他长得什么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.30,1:06:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你信任他 他有一种力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trust him. He's got a strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.70,1:06:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意为约翰·康纳去死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd die for John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.46,1:06:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在至少知道 该给他取什么名字了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least now I know what to name him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.26,1:06:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不会知道他父亲是谁吧 好让我遇到他时不会让他滚开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't suppose you know who the father is so I won't tell him to get lost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.18,1:06:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰很少谈到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John never said much about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.10,1:06:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道他在战前就死了… - 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know he dies before the war… - Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.54,1:06:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.62,1:07:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是约翰派你来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was it John that sent you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.06,1:07:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我自愿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I volunteered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.82,1:07:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 这是一次认识传奇人物的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - It was a chance to meet the legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.70,1:07:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·康纳教育她的儿子奋斗 有条理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah Connor, who taught her son to fight, organize, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.74,1:07:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,时刻准备着 在他还小的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}prepare from when he was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.98,1:07:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们在战前四处躲藏时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were in hiding before the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.14,1:07:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用过去时说一些我还没有做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about things I haven't done yet in the past tense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.74,1:07:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我感到荒唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's driving me crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.50,1:07:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定没有找错人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you have the right person?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.42,1:07:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.62,1:07:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像那个未来的母亲吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Do I look like the mother of the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.18,1:07:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚强吗？有调理吗？我甚至无法做到收支平衡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, am I tough? Organized? I can't even balance my checkbook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.82,1:07:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有要求这个荣誉 我也不想要它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Reese, I didn't ask for this honor and I don't want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.10,1:08:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.86,1:08:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子要我告诉你 他要我把它背下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son gave me a message to give to you. Made me memorize it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.42,1:08:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,“感谢你在黑暗年代的勇气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thank you, Sarah, for your courage through the dark years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.26,1:08:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你即将面对的事 我帮不了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help you with what you must soon face, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.58,1:08:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能说未来还没有尘埃落定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}except to say the future is not set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.02,1:08:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要比想象中的自己更坚强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be stronger than you imagine you can be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.70,1:08:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要活下去 否则我永远不会存在”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must survive or I will never exist."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.54,1:08:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.98,1:08:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,包扎得很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good field dressing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.06,1:08:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.30,1:08:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我第一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.02,1:08:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡一会儿吧 天快亮了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some sleep. It'll be light soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.66,1:08:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.58,1:08:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,再跟我谈一会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me some more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.74,1:09:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.50,1:09:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你家在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about where you're from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.10,1:09:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.50,1:09:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你白天藏起来 晚上可以出来活动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay down by day, but at night you can move around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.18,1:09:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然要小心谨慎 因为捕猎的杀手使用红外线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still have to be careful because the H-Ks use infrared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.22,1:09:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们没有那么聪明 约翰教我们对付它们的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're not too bright. John taught us ways to dust them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.74,1:09:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是当那些渗透者出现时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when the infiltrators started to appear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.14,1:09:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结者是最新型的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Terminators were the newest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.82,1:09:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,最难对付的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.78,1:09:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,以搜索模式进入你的防区 你的位置以北750米处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traversing your sector in search mode. 750 meters north of your position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.34,1:09:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.94,1:10:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里斯 DN384… - 对 让他进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reese. DN384… - Right. Let him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.42,1:12:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结者！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terminator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.54,1:13:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做梦梦到了狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was dreaming about dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.10,1:13:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用狗来提防终结者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We use 'em to spot Terminators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.58,1:13:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的世界很可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your world is pretty terrifying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.90,1:14:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 里面有一只死猫吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, you got a dead cat in there or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.98,1:14:33.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（可能的回答）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.02,1:14:34.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（是/不是 或什么？ 走开 过一会再来）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.02,1:14:35.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（去你的 混蛋 去你的）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.02,1:14:37.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（去你的 混蛋）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.18,1:14:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.74,1:14:50.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（妈妈的小屋 大熊镇 云杉路181号）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.18,1:15:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.10,1:15:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.70,1:15:04.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迪基 汽车旅馆）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.94,1:15:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个够吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.10,1:15:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 我不想问你从哪弄来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's enough. I don't wanna ask where you got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.62,1:15:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来了 - 我们要一个房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm coming. - We need a room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.30,1:15:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 带厨房的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - With a kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.46,1:15:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有带厨房的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have one with a kitchen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.98,1:15:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想洗个澡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am dying for a shower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.46,1:15:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要检查一下你的绷带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should check your bandage, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.18,1:15:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后 我要出去买东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later. I'm going out for supplies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.58,1:15:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.82,1:16:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 我不能告诉你我在哪儿 有人告诉我不能说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't tell you where I am, Mom. I was told not to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.34,1:16:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要知道在哪儿能找到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need to know where to reach you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.70,1:16:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我躲在这间小屋中 却不告诉我发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me to hide out at the cabin and you won't tell me what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.98,1:16:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am worried sick here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.90,1:16:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这是电话号码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. OK, here's the number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.82,1:16:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？ - 是的 说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready? - Yes. Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.22,1:16:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,408-555-1439 九号房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 408-555-1439. Room nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.06,1:16:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记住了？ - 记住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it? - I've got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.98,1:16:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 抱歉 现在不能讲得太多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go. I'm sorry I can't tell you more right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.30,1:16:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.54,1:17:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, too, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.34,1:17:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪基汽车旅馆 - 告诉我你的地址{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tiki Motel. - Give me your address there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.42,1:17:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,买了些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.62,1:17:25.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（樟脑球）
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.22,1:17:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,樟脑球… 玉米糖浆… 氨水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mothballs… corn syrup… ammonia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.50,1:17:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚饭吃什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's for dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.86,1:17:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塑料炸弹 - 听起来不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Plastique. - That sounds good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.10,1:17:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.38,1:17:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,硝酸甘油基料 更稳定些的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a nitroglycerin base. It's a bit more stable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.10,1:17:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小的时候学会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned to make it when I was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.86,1:18:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别弄到线上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure there's none on the threads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.22,1:18:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.58,1:18:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把盖拧上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw the end cap on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.30,1:18:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻轻地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very gently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.58,1:18:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的童年一定很好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must've had a fun childhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.58,1:18:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.94,1:18:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 像这样再做六个 我来制作引信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Six more like that and I'll get started on the fuses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.46,1:18:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会找到我们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll find us, won't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.42,1:18:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.02,1:19:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事永远都完不了 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll never be over, will it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.58,1:19:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我 我在发抖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. I'm shaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.78,1:19:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一个传奇人物 你肯定很失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some legend. You must be pretty disappointed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.94,1:19:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.58,1:19:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 你那个时代的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle, the women in your time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.06,1:19:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们是什么样子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what are they like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.22,1:19:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,优秀的战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good fighters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.46,1:19:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.70,1:19:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有意中人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there someone special?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.58,1:19:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,意中人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.74,1:19:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.42,1:20:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.58,1:20:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.78,1:20:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.38,1:20:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.62,1:20:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多的痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.10,1:20:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦是可控的 只要别去想它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain can be controlled. You just disconnect it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.58,1:20:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就没有感觉吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you feel nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.02,1:20:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·康纳曾把你的相片给过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Connor gave me a picture of you once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.86,1:20:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我不明白原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know why at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.10,1:20:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是张很旧的 褪了色的照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was very old, torn, faded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.78,1:20:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很年轻 就像现在这个样子 只是有些悲伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were young like you are now. You seemed just a little sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.34,1:21:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想 你当时在想什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to always wonder what you were thinking at that moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.54,1:21:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能记得每一根纹路…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I memorized every line…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.26,1:21:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,…每一条曲线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…every curve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.82,1:21:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我穿越时空是为了你 莎拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came across time for you, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.66,1:21:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 一直爱着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. I always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.02,1:21:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该这样说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.54,1:23:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.82,1:24:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,交换位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trade places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.14,1:25:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿！开快点儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster! Drive faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.42,1:25:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔！哦 天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle! Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.82,1:26:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.42,1:26:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son-of-a-bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.50,1:27:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呆在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.46,1:27:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶快离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.30,1:27:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.70,1:27:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 快 起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle. Come on. Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.22,1:28:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.90,1:28:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我！出来 出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Get out. Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.26,1:28:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要停 跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop. Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.38,1:30:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.98,1:30:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.90,1:30:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 凯尔…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle. Kyle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.54,1:31:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it, Kyle. We got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.02,1:31:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.82,1:32:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.94,1:32:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.46,1:32:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护 这样他跟踪不到我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover, so he can't track us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.90,1:32:36.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（自动生产流程启动）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.34,1:32:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.66,1:32:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 凯尔！快点儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Kyle! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.10,1:32:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快！ - 别管我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Leave me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.98,1:33:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿 里斯！站起来 士兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it, Reese! On your feet, soldier!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.70,1:33:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.50,1:33:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.34,1:34:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,到后面去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back. Go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.54,1:35:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跑 莎拉 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run, Sarah. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.50,1:35:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.62,1:35:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.82,1:35:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, motherfucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.34,1:37:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.22,1:39:02.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（液压机启动）
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.02,1:39:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被终结了 该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're terminated, fucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.86,1:40:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.14,1:40:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,第七盘 11月10日 我在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tape seven. November 10. Where was I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.10,1:40:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,最难决定的是应该告诉你什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's most difficult is trying to decide what to tell you and what not to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.62,1:40:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但到你长大能明白磁带内容时 我还有时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I guess I have a while before you're old enough to understand these tapes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.82,1:40:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前来讲它们对我更重要 这样我可以把它说明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're more for me at this point just so that I can get it straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.70,1:41:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,加满{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill her up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.70,1:41:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是否该告诉你 关于你父亲的事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I tell you about your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.98,1:41:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 这可是个难题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, that's a tough one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.78,1:41:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果知道他是你父亲 会影响你派他来此的决定吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it affect your decision to send him here, knowing that he is your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.54,1:41:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不派凯尔来这里 那就不会有你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't send Kyle, you can never be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.46,1:41:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 整天想着这事 人都要发疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, a person could go crazy thinking about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.22,1:41:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我会告诉你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose I will tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.94,1:41:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了他 我必须这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe him that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.14,1:42:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许它能有所帮助…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it'll help if…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.62,1:42:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,…如果你知道在我们共处的那段时间…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you know that in the few hours that we had together…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.74,1:42:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我们相爱得无怨无悔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we loved a lifetime's worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.02,1:42:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在说什么？ - 他说你长得很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did he just say? - He says you're very beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.06,1:42:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不好意思向你索要5美元的照相费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is ashamed to ask you for five American dollars for this picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.10,1:42:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是如果不向你索要 他爸爸就会揍他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if he doesn't, his father will beat him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.66,1:42:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真会做生意 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty good hustle, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.74,1:42:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚才说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he just say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.06,1:42:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说风暴就要来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said there's a storm coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.58,1:43:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
